{"kind":"FETCH","data":{"headers":{},"body":"{\"id\":72962,\"title\":\"George and A.J.\",\"tagline\":\"\",\"overview\":\"George and A.J. is a short film created by Pixar which uses characters from the film Up to tell what Nurses George and A.J. did after Carl Fredricksen left with his house tied to balloons in the feature film.\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/dNdkTs0FLF8CkFOrA5RkTyyDspx.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/5e5MIo5Q00cJPKLAQPjEVtQwVlW.jpg\",\"rating\":5.8,\"voteCount\":178,\"year\":2009,\"runtime\":4,\"genres\":[\"Animation\",\"Family\",\"Comedy\"],\"status\":\"Released\",\"type\":\"movie\",\"countries\":[{\"code\":\"US\",\"name\":\"United States of America\"}],\"budget\":0,\"revenue\":0,\"director\":\"Josh Cooley\",\"cast\":[{\"id\":84496,\"name\":\"Josh Cooley\",\"character\":\"Director\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/eGN0vaFmKtqHu1nFi3Lv4roQ6P2.jpg\"},{\"id\":137262,\"name\":\"Steve Purcell\",\"character\":\"Carl Fredricksen (voice)\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/8wdCJVDq7v4g5N9Qkv8D87B3Xne.jpg\"},{\"id\":567732,\"name\":\"Jason Topolski\",\"character\":\"George (voice)\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/PFp8DkZR95OYgvuXZqlDBB3QXi.jpg\"},{\"id\":10,\"name\":\"Bob Peterson\",\"character\":\"Dug (voice)\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/dJe3nTCIToebjj1WHFHP7LmZKyk.jpg\"},{\"id\":1443479,\"name\":\"A.J. Riebli III\",\"character\":\"A.J. (voice)\",\"photo\":null},{\"id\":21198,\"name\":\"Peter Sohn\",\"character\":\"Russell (voice)\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/8cQGViF2lXlcsAIvFUMWboXYXIu.jpg\"},{\"id\":2860283,\"name\":\"Kim Donovan\",\"character\":\"Reporter (voice)\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/u9wQpCGZHnIHCY7xZFBy2Adq4cH.jpg\"},{\"id\":5214631,\"name\":\"Claire Munzer\",\"character\":\"Old Lady (voice)\",\"photo\":null},{\"id\":225978,\"name\":\"Valerie LaPointe\",\"character\":\"Cat Lady (voice)\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/6bvaPm3vqVnMVwKaDtuK2qoAvTd.jpg\"},{\"id\":35219,\"name\":\"Corey Burton\",\"character\":\"Various (voice) (uncredited)\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/wcpFwdL7m01cZoBJiUSMQVakK2G.jpg\"},{\"id\":35172,\"name\":\"Robert Clotworthy\",\"character\":\"Various (voice) (uncredited)\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/3VSCCuiUapFIPodhCHaahltCs5r.jpg\"},{\"id\":60232,\"name\":\"David Cowgill\",\"character\":\"Various (voice) (uncredited)\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/A3OFXT1LRCzIjvV7VXe4SDTg5U.jpg\"},{\"id\":15373,\"name\":\"Rif Hutton\",\"character\":\"Various (voice) (uncredited)\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/1RqWCEgCr3K47QxKoWiPEoT8pBZ.jpg\"},{\"id\":167638,\"name\":\"Justin Shenkarow\",\"character\":\"Various (voice) (uncredited)\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/uxy54aFyWM1Bow5P9EAY4iCyMbu.jpg\"}],\"similar\":[{\"id\":13394,\"title\":\"Shrek the Halls\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/nBfeTZ5ftAbkZXCnGMaCsiA3vOa.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/5lUaKCo9ypmXbuVeZqKQ9gm8zk4.jpg\",\"rating\":6.4,\"year\":2007,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"The Christmas tree isn't the only thing green in this new holiday classic. Shrek is back and trying to get into the spirit of the season. After promising Fiona and the kids a Christmas they'll remember, he is forced to take a crash course in the holiday. But just when he thinks he has everything for their quiet family Christmas just right, there is a knock at the door.\",\"genres\":[\"Adventure\",\"Animation\",\"Comedy\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":82881,\"title\":\"Tangled Ever After\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/5IeMW79OxftIUoR5duxyQ4LW5Iy.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/6qvKbLYkfXXKM82M38UmDz3IfBk.jpg\",\"rating\":7.1,\"year\":2012,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"The kingdom is in a festive mood as everyone gathers for the royal wedding of Rapunzel and Flynn. However, when Pascal and Maximus, as flower chameleon and ring bearer, respectively, lose the gold bands, a frenzied search and recovery mission gets underway. As the desperate duo tries to find the rings before anyone discovers that they’re missing, they leave behind a trail of comical chaos that includes flying lanterns, a flock of doves, a wine barrel barricade and a very sticky finale. Will Maximus and Pascal save the day and make it to the church in time? And will they ever get Flynn’s nose right?\",\"genres\":[\"Animation\",\"Comedy\",\"Action\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":460793,\"title\":\"Olaf's Frozen Adventure\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/As8WTtxXs9e3cBit3ztTf7zoRmm.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/64Rw7FFXTzx59qlugqxPB6YctFD.jpg\",\"rating\":6.5,\"year\":2017,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"Olaf is on a mission to harness the best holiday traditions for Anna, Elsa, and Kristoff.\",\"genres\":[\"Animation\",\"Family\",\"Adventure\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":326359,\"title\":\"Frozen Fever\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/mPrDJ7puYzPLG5kPM96iNszF2sM.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/tQNop6scGYjapYo8j4wCSoVls0i.jpg\",\"rating\":6.8,\"year\":2015,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"On Anna's birthday, Elsa and Kristoff are determined to give her the best celebration ever, but Elsa's icy powers may put more than just the party at risk.\",\"genres\":[\"Animation\",\"Family\",\"Comedy\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":1139087,\"title\":\"Once Upon a Studio\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/aiy3G1cYWV3LgKZHY6a3jL8bjYL.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/8KJMOKyl9rpgb9ELEwhfBMIaTHw.jpg\",\"rating\":8.2,\"year\":2023,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"Created for Disney's 100th anniversary, the short features Mickey Mouse corralling a gallery of legendary Disney characters for a group photo.\",\"genres\":[\"Animation\",\"Family\",\"Fantasy\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":1371727,\"title\":\"Sing: Thriller\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/g0PZr8TYqIhSWq1EPmTisIqfr0K.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/9Rhs8yzMTtAcOUvJXqUg7kzljb7.jpg\",\"rating\":7.1,\"year\":2024,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"Buster Moon dreams up a star-studded spectacle set to Michael Jackson's \\\"Thriller\\\" in this animated short featuring characters from the hit \\\"Sing\\\" films.\",\"genres\":[\"Animation\",\"Comedy\",\"Fantasy\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":47626,\"title\":\"Legend of the BoneKnapper Dragon\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/74OqO31AaubZGgreiHIomFyOXUx.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/vkBMhUSaDUk3JUCS2VUk160IXMM.jpg\",\"rating\":7.1,\"year\":2010,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"Hiccup and friends accompany their mentor, Gobber, on a quest to kill the legendary Boneknapper Dragon.\",\"genres\":[\"Animation\",\"Fantasy\",\"Family\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":256835,\"title\":\"Toy Story That Time Forgot\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/kVOaFo8RaYQceHfTqbZGmV9R80q.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/4vetbabOgDQzpitnAkEVRiZP4P5.jpg\",\"rating\":7.1,\"year\":2014,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"During a post-Christmas play date, the gang find themselves in uncharted territory when the coolest set of action figures ever turn out to be dangerously delusional. It's all up to Trixie, the triceratops, if the gang hopes to return to Bonnie's room in this Toy Story That Time Forgot.\",\"genres\":[\"Animation\",\"Family\",\"Adventure\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":1076364,\"title\":\"Carl's Date\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/wakoF2UgsEE3fGs5KpuwMWsaNr2.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/wLttOcR1wJGedXfpe69y215NvjN.jpg\",\"rating\":7.4,\"year\":2023,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"Carl Fredricksen reluctantly agrees to go on a date with a lady friend—but admittedly has no idea how dating works these days. Ever the helpful friend, Dug steps in to calm Carl's pre-date jitters and offer some tried-and-true tips for making friends—if you're a dog.\",\"genres\":[\"Animation\",\"Family\",\"Comedy\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":13934,\"title\":\"Mater and the Ghostlight\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/thZHluscCvT3SCzVckmFszOVVtM.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/cKO6MZ9uf6wRcMA0TldRCYxKYzx.jpg\",\"rating\":6.3,\"year\":2006,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"Mater, the rusty but trusty tow truck from Cars, spends a day in Radiator Springs playing scary pranks on his fellow townsfolk. That night at Flo's V8 Café, the Sheriff tells the story of the legend of the Ghostlight, and as everyone races home Mater is left alone primed for a good old-fashioned scare.\",\"genres\":[\"Animation\",\"Comedy\",\"Family\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":50393,\"title\":\"Kung Fu Panda Holiday\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/vJv3pI8pyS13rLjy0ok7a3BiE0a.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/cMR6Mpo8N6JVKbEuxet6N0p1NMA.jpg\",\"rating\":7,\"year\":2010,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"The Winter Feast is Po's favorite holiday. Every year he and his father hang decorations, cook together, and serve noodle soup to the villagers. But this year Shifu informs Po that as Dragon Warrior, it is his duty to host the formal Winter Feast at the Jade Palace. Po is caught between his obligations as the Dragon Warrior and his family traditions: between Shifu and Mr. Ping.\",\"genres\":[\"Animation\",\"Family\",\"TV Movie\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":40619,\"title\":\"Day & Night\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/hn2tOtidoYZ0D56jR4yknpdP1mU.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/i05QKKn8GqAdmQSeAztxhuqN6dt.jpg\",\"rating\":7.7,\"year\":2010,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"When Day, a sunny fellow, encounters Night, a stranger of distinctly darker moods, sparks fly! Day and Night are frightened and suspicious of each other at first, and quickly get off on the wrong foot. But as they discover each other's unique qualities--and come to realize that each of them offers a different window onto the same world-the friendship helps both to gain a new perspective.\",\"genres\":[\"Animation\",\"Family\",\"Comedy\"],\"daysUntil\":null}],\"videos\":[{\"key\":\"CgoSM7BJJYI\",\"name\":\"George And A.J. - Trailer\",\"site\":\"YouTube\",\"type\":\"Trailer\"}],\"daysUntil\":null}","status":200,"url":""},"revalidate":86400,"tags":[]}